          <span class="kicker">Convert it with the math shown</span>
          <h3>Try the free Unit and Currency Converter</h3>
          <p>Length, weight, temperature, volume, speed, area, and currency, with the exact formula shown and a US, UK, and Metric toggle. No signup, in your browser.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="/calculators/unit-currency-converter/">Open the Unit and Currency Converter</a>
        </div>

